{title: Khairiyat}
{artist: Arijit Singh Pritam}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm] Khairiyat [A#] pucho,        Kabhi to [G#] kaifiyat [A#] pucho
Tumhaare [Fm] bin diwaane [A#] ka,        Kya haal [G] hai
[Cm] Dil mera [A#] dekho,        Na meri [G#] haisiyat [A#] pucho
Tere [Fm] bin ek din [A#] jaise,        Sau saal [G] hai
Anjaam [Fm] hai tay [A#] mera,        Hona [D#] tumhe hai [G#] mera
Kitni bhi [A#] ho [Gm] dooriyaan,        filhal [G] hai
[A#] Yeh dooriyaan [G#] filhal [G] hai,        Tumhari [Cm] tasveer ke [G#] sahare
[Cm] Mausam kayi [G#] guzaare,        [Fm] Mausami naa [G#] smjho
Parr [A#] ishq ko [G] humare,        [Cm] Nazaaro ke [G#] samne me
[Cm] Aata nhi [G#] tumhare,        Magar [Fm] rhte ho [G#] har pal
[A#] Manzar me tum [G] humare,        Gar ishq [Fm] se hai [A#] mila
Fir dard [D#] se kya [G#] gila,        Is dard [A#] me [Gm] zindagi
khushhaal [G] hai,        [A#] Ye dooriyaan [G#] filhal [G] hai
